.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt INTEL_LID 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm intel_lid
.Nd Poll the values of different reports about laptop lid state
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "SYNOPSIS"
.Bd -literal
     intel_lid
.Ed
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     intel_lid is a tool to poll ACPI and the BIOS scratch register's
     reporting of laptop lid state. This can be used for debugging issues with
     laptop modesetting for lid opening and closing.
.Ed
